# Waking Dreams (battlefield.waking_dreams#reqs, The Shrouded Maw): Three chars trigger the entry: main (quest
# accepted, no vial) and bob (vial, no quest) get NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7103 (the framework's trigger refusal) and a
# release; cat (quest accepted, vial) gets event 32000.
lists TheShroudedMaw/MC_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=TheShroudedMaw pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
quest Windurst.WakingDreams accepted
bob: keyitem VialOfDreamIncense
cat: quest Windurst.WakingDreams accepted
cat: keyitem VialOfDreamIncense
login
bob: login
cat: login
trigger MC_Entrance
bob: trigger MC_Entrance
cat: trigger MC_Entrance
